Z||000030||Formula||09-12-2001||02:25 PM||||Mine comes from the number 4, hence the For part. Then I thought to myself, I don't even have 4 Fieros. So, while I smashed the desk with my hand I yelped MULA FUTHER (or something like that and I thought, hmmm, 4motha, then I looked outside and saw written on the side of my fiero was a word that rhymed with 4mutha, and it was Formula.  Which to this day is my name on many boards, from sea to shining sea!!!<P>Many are copiers of my 4mutha name of Formula, but there is only one true FORMULA (cept for the thousands produced and the other 4 on this board lol)<P><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/StrokeThis.jpg"> ||||reg||1
