Z||000032||Fiero5||09-12-2001||03:15 PM||||I guess looking back now, maybe I should have come up with something like lotsoffieros or toomanyfieros or something similar.<BR>I was in a hurry to get on Pennocks at the time I registered as I wanted to post something, and I was driving my "Fiero5" to shows that year. I would hear people say, "Here he comes in Fiero5" when I would drive into a show, as that is what the license plate reads on that 87 coupe. So I tried Fiero5 on the Pennocks registration and it took it.<BR>This year I have been switching back and forth from Fiero1 and Fiero9 at shows. I am also getting ready to fix up Fiero7, maybe in time for a few last shows this year.<P>That's all there is, there is no more...<P>Steve<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/halfpole.gif"> <p>[This message has been edited by Fiero5 (edited 09-12-2001).]||||reg||6
