Z||000058||BlackDragon||09-13-2001||01:42 AM||||well, in high school, i played a lot of Quake and starcraft, and i was exceptionaly ruthless. from this i got the name NatasGnik.<BR>(read it in reverse) well, the name stuck for a while, but i kept getting kicked out of chat rooms when people figured out what it meant(and i thought it sounded a little satanic, and that is not me). so i changed it to NG. well, that was a little too shoet, so i changed it to NG_BlackDragon, cause i like black, and i like dragons, and NG was in reference to the first nickname. then as time went on, people started calling me blackdragon, so i shortened it. hence the name BlackDragon    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">  just thought i would give you the full story.<P>and for the record, i caught Oreif the first time i read it, i have a friend who goes by Nogard, my group of people uses reverse often. other friends go by Rekoj, Nomed, Emong, etc... that way the name you pick is rarely taken  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR>long description?<P>------------------<BR>WTB:CHEAP black standard fiero. no engine is fine, any model/condition grey interior is a plus||||reg||1
