Z||000079||Formula88||09-14-2001||06:37 PM||||Well, I picked Formula88 because I have an 88 Formula, and couldn't think of anyting original when I signed onto the forum.  I also use Ladco77 on other forums.  L.A.D.Co. standing for the "Last Act of Defiance Company" - it was a gaming group I used to be in, not to mention a gaming philosophy.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I added the 77 in honor of my father's old dirt track 32 Ford racecar, which was #77.<P>I use saturn5 on some because I used to work for NASA, but you'd be amazed at how many places that's already been taken.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Oh, and I used WARPDRIV right after high school.  That was my personalized liscense plate on my '87 Grand National, and then later on my '72 Trans Am.  It seemed fitting.  Neither car ever lost a race.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
